Goals are broad, long-term outcomes — the project's reason for existing.
Per `docs/02-hierarchy.md` §2, 1–3 Goals per project. More than three Goals is
usually two projects bundled together.

Goals carry the highest ratification authority (R11 ladder). The practitioner
ratifies Goals; the agent does not invent new Goals during execution. New Goal
discoveries route to OPEN_QUESTIONS.md, not directly into this file.

