## Objectives

- **O1** (under G1) — <outcome-shaped name>
- **O2** (under G1) — <outcome-shaped name>

<!--
Objectives are specific short-to-medium-term results that break a Goal into
actionable work. 3–10 per Goal per `docs/02-hierarchy.md` §2.

Prefer outcome-shaped names ("Topics locked," "Stakeholders aligned") over
process-shaped names ("Pull data," "Run analysis"). Per `docs/02-hierarchy.md` §6:
if an Objective's name could plausibly become a Milestone title, it is probably
shaped as a process. Reshape it.

Objective additions during execution are agent discretion (R11 ladder). Surface
material changes that shift what the practitioner thinks the project delivers;
otherwise append atomically with a one-paragraph rationale in decisions.md.
-->

